However, in the companies extension taxonomy NetCashProvidedByUsedInContinuingOperations includes EffectOfExchangeRateOnCashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalents as a summation-child. Consider using  CashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalentsPeriodIncreaseDecreaseIncludingExchangeRateEffect  instead of NetCashProvidedByUsedInContinuingOperations.


